their behaviour and spawns back, Roving Cube caught with the Talisman of the Cube in a redstone
symbol, Cube of Annihilation kept to castle blocks, the dungeon exit typo that kept the second
dungeon level and the forge from generating, castles generated before finished in place,
advancements and the Rune Scepter.
