+/**
+ * The Rune Sovereign: the boss of the Final Castle, waiting in the violet gazebo on the castle roof
+ * (Wilds &amp; Wanderers completion of the castle; the entity, its spawner and its home were already laid out by TF).
+ * <p>
+ * Phase I volleys rune bolts, blinks away when pressed and calls Adherents. At 65% and 30% health it raises four
+ * {@link RuneWard}s: while any stands it takes no damage, and when the last falls it drops, stunned, taking double
+ * damage. From phase II it marks rune circles under its target that burst after a warning. The fair-fight rules
+ * live in {@link CastleBossRules}; nobody near for 30 s resets the fight.
+ */
 public class PlateauBoss extends BaseTFBoss {
 
+	public static final float MAX_HEALTH = 450.0F;
+	/** Health added for every extra player near the gazebo when the Sovereign appears. */
+	public static final float HEALTH_PER_EXTRA_PLAYER = 0.4F;
+	public static final int MAX_EXTRA_PLAYERS = 4;
+	public static final float WARD_THRESHOLD_1 = 0.65F;
+	public static final float WARD_THRESHOLD_2 = 0.30F;
+	public static final int WARD_COUNT = 4;
+	public static final int STUN_TICKS = 60;
+	public static final int DEATH_TICKS = 60;
+	public static final float BOLT_DAMAGE = 4.0F;
+	public static final float CIRCLE_DAMAGE = 8.0F;
+	/** Half the width of the gazebo (21 blocks with its walls) around the spawner. */
